{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587450/extras/a76e20e1a8c03c5de0414c9968485e25.avif?t=1761571115\" width=1560 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587450/extras/fd0f9d764280ff9dbc5826394ff2a2e5.poster.avif?t=1761571115\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587450/extras/fd0f9d764280ff9dbc5826394ff2a2e5.webm?t=1761571115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Crispy Circuits, you step into the shoes of Giddily, and her loyal hamster helper Crispy. She's a young inventor with boundless imagination. He's a small, stocky rodent with an appetite for destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587450/extras/9556e622410610c00ab1b717def700dc.avif?t=1761571115\" width=1560 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587450/extras/48caebad7651acd18c729998be357aea.poster.avif?t=1761571115\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587450/extras/48caebad7651acd18c729998be357aea.webm?t=1761571115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587450/extras/48caebad7651acd18c729998be357aea.mp4?t=1761571115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, connect, and occasionally explode your way through a series of challenges based on real-world electrical problems. Using a physically accurate SPICE simulator, you assemble circuits, explore electrical concepts, and solve creative puzzles that blend learning with laughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587450/extras/8ec5c612813b7eadaba02f8b9f264d8f.avif?t=1761571115\" width=1560 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587450/extras/e3351bd0a0dc54912a25ea7053148b04.poster.avif?t=1761571115\" width=616 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587450/extras/e3351bd0a0dc54912a25ea7053148b04.webm?t=1761571115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When he is not containing his animal instincts, he is a very helpful sidekick to our protagonist Giddily. If she is suffering from tunnel vision, he always finds a way to think outside the box. He uses his trusty hamster wheel to generate power for the experiments they conduct together. His only wish in this world is to be able to fly again. That is why he is hell-bent on making Giddily fix his RC aeroplane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587450/extras/0bc9cabd97895cdc81aa6aa97bfaa7e6.avif?t=1761571115\" width=1560 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587450/extras/f4efa686720053f9adfe3cbb2f3da811.poster.avif?t=1761571115\" width=616 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587450/extras/f4efa686720053f9adfe3cbb2f3da811.webm?t=1761571115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game presents you with a problem and a set of tools to solve it. Instead of directly guiding you towards a solution, the game encourages you to explore ideas with a <i><strong>fail fast, fail often attitude</strong></i>. Through that process you get a better understanding of the problem, learning how to utilise the tools and arrive at a solution. A few electrocutions and explosions on the way are a bonus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-financed by the Croatian Audiovisual Centre</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587450/extras/8901f7dcadb2ef439d4fcce0db10ac43.avif?t=1761571115\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3587450?t=1761571115","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3587450?t=1761571115","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587450/60f06de557fccb26934d2f6c638d8a84ca5a2f0c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761571115","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587450/60f06de557fccb26934d2f6c638d8a84ca5a2f0c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761571115","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587450/extras/a76e20e1a8c03c5de0414c9968485e25.avif?t=1761571115\" width=1560 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587450/extras/fd0f9d764280ff9dbc5826394ff2a2e5.poster.avif?t=1761571115\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587450/extras/fd0f9d764280ff9dbc5826394ff2a2e5.webm?t=1761571115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Crispy Circuits, you step into the shoes of Giddily, and her loyal hamster helper Crispy. She's a young inventor with boundless imagination. He's a small, stocky rodent with an appetite for destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587450/extras/9556e622410610c00ab1b717def700dc.avif?t=1761571115\" width=1560 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587450/extras/48caebad7651acd18c729998be357aea.poster.avif?t=1761571115\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets